--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IMPLEMENTATION (SwiftUI + Apple HIG)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- Navigation entry: AutomationCardRouteRegistration.swift exposes the unrouted
  unit as a typed NavigationDestination (AutomationCardLink + View
  .automationCardDestination(provider:)) any NavigationStack/NavigationSplitView
  can deep-link, plus AutomationCardRouteRegistration.make(provider:) for a
  ready-built screen — the exact seam shape the sibling unrouted page uses
  (no top-level AppRoute claimed; .automations is owned by AutomationsList).
- Screen scaffold: AutomationCardPage (SwiftUI View) + @Observable @MainActor
  AutomationCardPageModel exposing typed state (AutomationCardState) + connection
  + async load()/refresh(); no business logic in the view body; ADR-004 (no
  networking — resolves over an injectable AutomationCardProviding snapshot seam,
  default = local state, matching the manifest "renders from navigation values /
  local state").
- Panel: the web GlassPanel reproduced by the hosted TSGlassPanel card (P3
  shared component) on P2 design tokens — no hand-rolled glass, no hardcoded
  colors/typography.
- Adaptive (ADR-002/006): compact iPhone fills width; macOS/iPad cap the single
  card to a readable measure (horizontalSizeClass; #if os gated).
- Data states: the page drives the card across loading (skeleton) / empty
  (ContentUnavailableView-style empty card) / error (message + Retry) / loaded;
  the manifest's required `success` state renders from the bound @Observable
  state holder. Never a blank region.
- Live data (ADR-013): the live isFiring pulse downgrades to a stale/offline chip
  via AutomationLiveConnection surfaced by the model.
- i18n (ADR-014): every visible literal via LocalizedStringKey / catalog
  localizer; web key names preserved verbatim.
- a11y (ADR-015): VoiceOver labels/traits on the card header, toggle, pin and
  kebab menu; Dynamic Type; light/dark; ≥44pt targets (inherited from the card +
  the page scaffold's teslaSyncTheme()).
- Units (ADR-005): N/A for this card (no SI quantities); timestamps formatted at
  the display boundary by the card's locale-aware formatters.

